launchSettings.json

# Configuration convention: appsettings.json carries localhost defaults only and
# IS tracked, so a fresh clone builds and runs. Anything that is a real
# credential in any environment has no in-repo default and comes from DM_* env
# vars or a secrets/ file; a missing value fails at startup rather than falling
# back to a value everyone can read. Blanket-ignoring appsettings.json is what
# left the worker projects without configuration on a fresh clone.
#
# The localhost values of the keys a host refuses to start without - the two
# connection strings and the object-store account - live in the tracked
# appsettings.Development.json instead, which a Production host does not read and
# the image does not carry. In the base file they answered the very check written
# to catch their absence, and a deployment that lost DM_ConnectionStrings__Rdb
# started against localhost instead of stopping.
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.local.json
secrets/

# Nginx credentials for the preview stand. Generated on the host by
# docker/scripts/init-htpasswd.sh and never committed: git keeps every version
# of what it once tracked, and an ignore entry does nothing for a path already
# in the index, so a hash committed once is public from then on.
docker/nginx/.htpasswd

# Docker environment secrets
docker/.env
docker/.env.mirror

# Claude Code: the agent configuration is part of the project, so it is
# versioned. Two hooks refuse the commands that lose work (git checkout, reset
# --hard, clean -fd, stash drop) and the ones that would add a second
# migration; both enforce rules the repository states nowhere else in an
# executable form, and while this directory was ignored they existed on one
# machine only. What stays out is machine- and session-local.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.doctor-backup
.claude/worktrees/

# Build artifacts: the OpenAPI contract is emitted by the integration suite
# and uploaded by CI, not committed - a checked-in copy goes stale silently.
artifacts/*
# Слепок контракта API коммитится: по нему фронтовый тест сверяет свои модели,
# и изменение схемы видно в ревью одной строкой.
!artifacts/openapi-contract.json

# Test artifacts
test_*.json
cookies*.txt
*_response.json

# TypeScript incremental build state — regenerated by every type-check
*.tsbuildinfo

# Windows null device artifact. Case-insensitive on purpose: the file is created
# as NUL, and a lowercase pattern only matches it on a case-insensitive checkout.
[Nn][Uu][Ll]


# OWASP ZAP scan scratch output (created by zap-baseline.py in CI and locally)
zap.yaml
report_json.json
report_md.md
report_html.html

# Playwright: отчеты и артефакты прогонов
src/DM.Web.Client/test-results/
src/DM.Web.Client/playwright-report/
src/DM.Web.Client/blob-report/

src/DM.Web.Client/e2e/.auth/
